{"seq":3,"slug":"measurability","title":"勒贝格可测性：可定义就不会失去测度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/descriptive-set-theory/regularity/measurability","wordCount":1601,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"勒贝格可测性-可定义就不会失去测度\">勒贝格可测性：可定义就不会失去测度</h1><p>在三大正则性质里，勒贝格可测性最贴近日常数学——分析、概率、遍历论时刻都在假设手边的集合有测度。描述集合论对它的贡献是给出一条清晰的保证：只要一个集合能被写下来（哪怕复杂到解析层），它就一定可测；不可测集必然需要选择公理才能存在。这一篇不重讲测度的构造（那属于 <a href=\"../../real-analysis-measure/integration/lebesgue-measure\">实分析与测度</a>），而是聚焦描述集合论特有的问题：可测性如何随复杂度爬升、Vitali 集为何是不可测的原型、以及索洛维那个「万物皆可测」的著名模型付出了什么代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从可测到普遍可测\">核心概念：从可测到普遍可测</h2><p>回顾一个测度论事实：勒贝格测度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 在 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>-代数上定义，再通过「外测度逼近」完备化到勒贝格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>-代数——后者比 Borel 大，多出的是所有「被零测集包含」的集合。描述集合论关心的是比 Borel 更复杂的集合是否仍落在这个完备 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>-代数内。</p>\n<p>有一个比「勒贝格可测」更稳健的概念——<strong>普遍可测（universally measurable）</strong>：集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 对每个波兰空间上的每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>-有限 Borel 测度都可测。普遍可测的好处是它不绑定某一个特定测度，因而是描述集合论陈述定理的自然单位。核心事实：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mtext> 是解析集</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>A</mi><mtext> 普遍可测</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\text{ 是解析集} \\implies A \\text{ 普遍可测}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">是解析集</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">普遍可测</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即 <a href=\"../hierarchies/analytic-sets\">解析集</a> 全部普遍可测，因而尤其勒贝格可测。证明用测度的正则性配合苏斯林运算：解析集能被内部的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>-紧集从内逼近，测度差被压到任意小。这条结果和 PSP、BP 在解析层齐步成立，共同标出 ZFC 舒适区的上界。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;集合 A&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;A 可定义?&lt;br/&gt;(至多解析层)&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[&quot;普遍可测&lt;br/&gt;⟹ 勒贝格可测&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|否, 靠 AC 构造| D[&quot;可能不可测&lt;br/&gt;如 Vitali 集&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E[&quot;内正则: σ-紧集从内逼近&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F{&quot;需要选择公理?&quot;}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[&quot;ZFC 才能证其存在&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt;|放弃部分 AC| H[&quot;Solovay 模型:&lt;br/&gt;所有集合可测&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"集合 A\"] --&gt; B{\"A 可定义?&lt;br/&gt;(至多解析层)\"}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[\"普遍可测&lt;br/&gt;⟹ 勒贝格可测\"]\n  B --&gt;|否, 靠 AC 构造| D[\"可能不可测&lt;br/&gt;如 Vitali 集\"]\n  C --&gt; E[\"内正则: σ-紧集从内逼近\"]\n  D --&gt; F{\"需要选择公理?\"}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[\"ZFC 才能证其存在\"]\n  F --&gt;|放弃部分 AC| H[\"Solovay 模型:&lt;br/&gt;所有集合可测\"]</pre><h2 id=\"vitali-集-不可测的原型\">Vitali 集：不可测的原型</h2><p>不可测集的最小反例是 Vitali 集，<a href=\"../foundations/why-descriptive-set-theory\">为何描述集合论</a> 已给出构造，这里从「为什么不可测是本质的」角度重述。Vitali 集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 由「每个有理数平移等价类各取一代表」组成，它的关键结构是：可数个不相交平移副本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{V+q : q\\in\\mathbb{Q}\\cap[0,1)\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8556em;vertical-align:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span></span></span></span></span> 恰好铺满 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>假设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 勒贝格可测，测度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda(V)=c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>。平移不变性给每个副本相同测度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，可数可加性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>q</mi></msub><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mo>⋃</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{q} c = \\lambda\\big(\\bigcup(V+q)\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">⋃</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是介于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 之间的有限正数。但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>q</mi></msub><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_q c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 只能是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>）或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>），无法落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[1,2]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>——矛盾。故 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 不可测。这个论证的核心是「平移不变 + 可数可加」的张力，任何不可测集本质上都在利用这种张力。而构造代表元的那一步无可回避地用到选择公理，这印证了描述集合论的中心判断：不可测是不可定义的同义词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三大性质的合与分\">三大性质的合与分</h2><p>把三条正则性质放在一起对照，能看清它们何时同行、何时分道。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>复杂度层</th>\n<th>勒贝格可测</th>\n<th>Baire 性质</th>\n<th>完美集性质</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Borel</td>\n<td>✓ ZFC</td>\n<td>✓ ZFC</td>\n<td>✓ ZFC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解析 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^1_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1371em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>✓ ZFC</td>\n<td>✓ ZFC</td>\n<td>✓ ZFC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>余解析 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Π</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Pi}^1_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1371em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Π</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>✓ ZFC</td>\n<td>✓ ZFC</td>\n<td>✗ 独立（需不可达）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^1_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1371em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>+</td>\n<td>独立</td>\n<td>独立</td>\n<td>独立</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三条性质在 Borel 与解析层完全同步，但从余解析层开始出现细微错位：可测性与 BP 在余解析层仍由 ZFC 保证，PSP 却已独立（见 <a href=\"perfect-set-property\">完美集性质</a>）。这说明它们逻辑上互相独立——存在可测却无 BP 的集合，也存在有 BP 却不可测的集合。尽管如此，它们有一个共同的「统一供应商」：<strong>集合被决定 ⟹ 三条性质全部成立</strong>。协变博弈（covering game）为可测性提供了与 Banach–Mazur 博弈之于 BP 平行的机制，这条统一通道是 <a href=\"../practice/determinacy\">决定性</a> 的核心成果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"索洛维模型-万物可测的代价\">索洛维模型：万物可测的代价</h2><p>如果不可测集必须靠选择公理，那放弃（部分）选择公理，能不能得到「所有集合都可测」的世界？1970 年罗伯特·索洛维（Robert Solovay）给出肯定回答，但标了价。</p>\n<p><strong>索洛维模型</strong>：从一个不可达基数出发，通过 Lévy 塌缩强制法构造出一个 ZF（含从属选择 DC，但不含完全选择公理 AC）的模型，其中<strong>每个实数集都勒贝格可测、都有 Baire 性质、都有完美集性质</strong>。这是「三大正则性质普遍成立」最著名的一致性结果。它的两点代价值得记住：其一，必须放弃完全选择公理（保留较弱的 DC，足够做分析）；其二，Shelah 后来证明可测性版本<strong>必须</strong>用到不可达基数（去不掉），而 BP 版本不需要——这个不对称呼应了 <a href=\"baire-property\">Baire 性质</a> 里 Shelah 结果的讨论，再次显示测度的一致性强度高于纲畴。</p>\n<p>索洛维模型的深远意义在于它把「病态集合」彻底定位成选择公理的产物：在一个只保留可定义构造能力的宇宙里，Vitali、Bernstein、Banach–Tarski 全部消失。这从反面完整印证了描述集合论开篇的赌注——可定义即规矩。它也为下一章 AD（决定性公理）铺路：AD 是比「万物可测」更强的统一原理，能在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(\\mathbb{R})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 内一举给出全部正则性质。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>普遍可测比勒贝格可测更稳健（不绑定单一测度）；解析集全部普遍可测，与 PSP、BP 在解析层齐步，标出 ZFC 舒适区上界。</li>\n<li>Vitali 集不可测的本质是「平移不变 + 可数可加」的张力，构造代表元无可回避地用选择公理——不可测 = 不可定义。</li>\n<li>三性质在 Borel、解析层同步，余解析层起错位（可测/BP 仍 ZFC，PSP 已独立）；逻辑上互相独立，但决定性是它们的统一供应商。</li>\n<li>索洛维模型（从不可达基数）给出「万物可测 + 有 BP + 有 PSP」的 ZF+DC 世界，代价是放弃完全 AC；可测性版本必须用不可达基数，纲畴版本不必。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章邻篇：<a href=\"perfect-set-property\">完美集性质</a>、<a href=\"baire-property\">Baire 性质</a> —— 三性质的强度谱系。</li>\n<li>决定性如何一举兑现三性质：<a href=\"../practice/determinacy\">决定性</a>。</li>\n<li>病态集合的选择公理来源：<a href=\"../foundations/why-descriptive-set-theory\">为何描述集合论</a>。</li>\n<li>勒贝格测度、外测度、完备化的构造细节：<a href=\"../../real-analysis-measure/integration/lebesgue-measure\">实分析与测度 · 勒贝格测度</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"勒贝格可测性：可定义就不会失去测度","id":"勒贝格可测性-可定义就不会失去测度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从可测到普遍可测","id":"核心概念-从可测到普遍可测"},{"level":2,"text":"Vitali 集：不可测的原型","id":"vitali-集-不可测的原型"},{"level":2,"text":"三大性质的合与分","id":"三大性质的合与分"},{"level":2,"text":"索洛维模型：万物可测的代价","id":"索洛维模型-万物可测的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Baire 性质：拓扑意义上的「几乎相等」","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/descriptive-set-theory/regularity/baire-property"},"next":{"title":"决定性：用无穷博弈一举兑现全部正则性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/descriptive-set-theory/practice/determinacy"}}